sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant JS as keyboard.js (Windows JS Bridge)
    participant AND as MainActivity (Android DispatchKeyEvent)
    participant MAC as KeyboardPageHandler (Mac Catalyst PressesBegan)
    participant BIS as BlazorInputService
    participant SM as ShortcutManager
    participant CD as CommandDispatcher
    participant DIM as DrawingInteractionManager
    participant EB as EventBus
    participant Store as WorkspaceStore
    participant NE as NavigationEngine
    participant AFC as AccessibilityFeedbackCoordinator
    participant BSM as BlazorSpeechManager
    participant SMM as SonificationManager

    Note over User, MAC: Platform Input (Windows / Android / Mac Catalyst)
    User->>JS: Press Key (Windows)
    JS->>BIS: OnKeyDown(key, modifiers)
    User->>AND: Press Key (Android)
    AND->>BIS: ProcessKey(key, shift, ctrl, alt)
    User->>MAC: Press Key (Mac hardware keyboard)
    MAC->>BIS: ProcessKey(key, shift, ctrl, alt)

    BIS->>SM: ResolveCommand(key, modifiers)
    SM->>CD: Dispatch(SystemCommand)

    Note over CD, Store: Pane Layout Commands (Alt+Up/Down, Ctrl+Alt+Shift+C)
    CD->>Store: ScrollIndicatorPanesAction(±1)
    CD->>EB: Publish(ChartFocusEvent)
    CD->>EB: Publish(FeedbackRequestEvent CONTEXT_SUMMARY)

    Note over CD, DIM: Drawing Flow (Ctrl+Shift+T/H/V/C/F/L)
    CD->>EB: Publish(AddDrawingEvent)
    EB->>DIM: HandleAddDrawing
    BIS->>DIM: HandleMouseEvent(coords)

    Note over CD, NE: Navigation Flow (Arrow keys, Home/End, PgUp/Dn)
    CD->>NE: ProcessNavigation
    NE->>Store: Dispatch(NavigateAction)
    NE-->>EB: Publish(FeedbackRequestEvent)

    par Async Feedback
        EB->>AFC: OnFeedbackRequest
        AFC->>BSM: Speak(formattedText)
    and Audio Note
        Store->>SMM: SyncNavigationSlots (via StateStream)
        SMM->>SMM: NavigationSonifier.SyncNavigationSlots
    end
